# Untitled

Thermodynamically controllable synthesis of ZIF-8 exposing different facets and their applications in single atom catalytic oxygen reduction reactions
Runze Ma\(^{1,\S}\), Qiheng Li\(^{2,\S}\), Jun Yan\(^{1}\) (✉), Yu Tao\(^{1}\), Shouyao Hu\(^{1}\), Donghao Liu\(^{1}\), Jiaxin Gong\(^{1}\), and Yu Xiong\(^{1}\) (✉)
\(^{1}\) College of Chemistry and Chemical Engineering, Central South University, Changsha 410083, China  \(^{2}\) Beijing Advanced Innovation Center for Materials Genome Engineering, Institute of Solid State Chemistry, University of Science and Technology Beijing, Beijing 100083, China  \(^{\S}\) Runze Ma and Qiheng Li contributed equally to this work.
